    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7fc78df2964e46a8ae9ae1919d50210d",
      "statement": "Talon runs subagent delegation inline during scheduled turns because no later conversational turn can consume a detached result; inline calls leave no job, serializes failure or timeout as sanitized error output, queues fan-out beyond the inline concurrency ceiling, and keeps recursion blocked.",
